      "updated": 1791210613378,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Requirements Gathering\n- MVP (Minimum Viable Product)\n    - Not half-finished\n    - Prioritization is super important\n- Interviewing\n    - Asking for frustrations/problems to be solved\n    - Options style questions\n    - Being specific \n    - Prototypes\n- Answering big question marks",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Requirements Gathering\n- MVP (Minimum Viable Product)\n    - Not half-finished\n    - Prioritization is super important\n- Interviewing\n    - Asking for frustrations/problems to be solved\n    - Options style questions\n    - Being specific \n    - Prototypes\n- Answering big question marks",
      "autoResize": true,
