      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791211089137,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "User Flows/User Stories\n- Things the user will do in the app and how the process looks to do those\n- Diagrams should be useful (not formal)\n- Different levels of complexity/depth involved (high level for screens, low level for actions)\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
