      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "9. Various forms of testing\n(this is generally done\nthroughout)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "JMA2EFG-V1bbK-r5SNHRq",
      "originalText": "9. Various forms of testing\n(this is generally done throughout)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "UUO0GukOj9ztDuwOSUjoE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2826.5161140987975,
      "y": 1771.9647902585166,
      "width": 1320.239013671875,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b00",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 209325026,
      "version": 412,
      "versionNonce": 249563646,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791214062178,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Types of testing\n- unit testing: one singular unit of code (function, button)\n- integration testing: testing one function in it's entirety (backend calls endpoint, checks DB update)\n- End-to-end testing: Open the full application as a user and make sure it works (can be automated, sometimes written as a test plan)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Types of testing\n- unit testing: one singular unit of code (function, button)\n- integration testing: testing one function in it's entirety (backend calls endpoint, checks DB update)\n- End-to-end testing: Open the full application as a user and make sure it works (can be automated, sometimes written as a test plan)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
